    <string name="battery_title">Keeping it alive for a long run</string>
    <string name="battery_help">Android will happily kill this app after an hour in your pocket. On a Samsung, open Settings → Apps → RunStick → Battery and choose <b>Unrestricted</b>, then Settings → Battery → Background usage limits and add RunStick to <b>Never auto sleeping apps</b>. The button below asks Android to exempt the app from battery optimisation, which covers the generic case.</string>
    <string name="battery_exempt">Ignore battery optimisation</string>
    <string name="battery_already_exempt">Already exempt from battery optimisation</string>
